// CAM Studio on a mill, as Onshape's Introduction to CAM Studio course runs it: the with-hole
// plate (60 × 40 × 10 with a Ø16 hole through, `Custom("with-hole")`) machined on a generic
// 3-axis Fanuc mill. The program goes to `target/exports/cam_studio_mill/`.
// 01 the "+" menu's Create CAM Studio made an empty tab: Jobs and Components, the toolbar.
// 02 Insert part: the Part Studio, the reference (workspace or a version), the plate ticked.
// 03 Create job: the plate as the body (all parts), a box stock 2 mm round it and 1 mm over.
// 04 Create machine: the catalogue by machine type, the travel and rates, the post settings.
// 05 Create setup: the program number, machine mating, the work coordinate system at the
//    stock's top centre (its triad in the view).
// 06 Create tool: the D6 end mill from the tool library.
// 07 Create toolpath: 2-axis profile round the outline and the hole, previewed live.
// 08 the profile calculated: its time in the Jobs list, the toolpath in the view.
// 09 a second toolpath: Bore (Holes) helix-mills the Ø16 hole.
// 10 Preview operation: the back plot of the bore 40 % through, the tool in the hole.
// 11 Verify: the stock as the bore leaves it, with what Verify found.
// 12 Post: the Fanuc program for the setup (program number, file, machine, units, operations,
//    the start of the G-code).
// 13 posted: the toast names the file.
Scenario(
    start: Some("document"),
    steps: [
        WaitFor("document-shell"),
        Custom("clear-dir target/exports/cam_studio_mill"),
        Custom("with-hole"),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("insert-tab")),
        WaitFor("create-cam-studio"),
        Click(ui("create-cam-studio")),
        WaitFor("cam-tree"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("01-empty-cam-studio"),
        Click(ui("cam-tb-insert")),
        WaitFor("cam-insert-part"),
        Click(ui("cam-insert-part")),
        WaitFor("cam-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("02-insert-part"),
        Click(ui("cam-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("cam-tb-job")),
        WaitFor("cam-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("03-create-job"),
        Click(ui("cam-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("cam-tb-machine")),
        WaitFor("cam-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("04-create-machine"),
        Click(ui("cam-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("cam-tb-setup")),
        WaitFor("cam-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("05-create-setup"),
        Click(ui("cam-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("cam-tb-tool")),
        WaitFor("cam-dialog"),
        Click(ui("cam-f-lib-tool")),
        Click(ui("cam-f-lib-tool-option-1")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("06-create-tool"),
        Click(ui("cam-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(3),
        Click(ui("cam-tb-toolpath")),
        WaitFor("cam-dialog"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("07-profile-preview"),
        Click(ui("cam-dialog-accept")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("08-profile"),
        Click(ui("cam-tb-toolpath")),
        WaitFor("cam-dialog"),
        Click(ui("cam-f-type")),
        Click(ui("cam-f-type-option-3")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(10),
        Screenshot("09-bore"),
        Click(ui("cam-dialog-accept")),
        Wait(5),
        Click(ui("cam-tb-preview")),
        WaitFor("cam-preview-bar"),
        Custom("cam preview-at 0.4"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("10-back-plot"),
        Click(ui("cam-pv-verify")),
        Custom("cam preview-end"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("11-verify"),
        Click(ui("cam-pv-close")),
        Custom("cam select setup 0"),
        Click(ui("cam-tb-post")),
        WaitFor("cam-export-dialog"),
        Click(ui("cam-export-folder")),
        Key("Ctrl+A"),
        Type("target/exports/cam_studio_mill"),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(3),
        Screenshot("12-post"),
        Click(ui("cam-export-ok")),
        MoveTo(1420, 900),
        Wait(5),
        Screenshot("13-posted"),
    ],
)
